// this is the module where confident claims are cheapest to make: about demand,
// pay, what employers want and what a learner is worth. Every lesson here gives
// a capture template, a privacy check, worked examples of what each level of
// evidence can carry, and a draft-then-review boundary before anything is sent
// or published.
